      "cooked": "<p>So, I think I understand this, but wanted to be sure.  If I have out multiple copies of this card, he becomes immune to the type of damage he just took.  The multiple copies just make it harder to get rid of his ongoing effect.  Or does it mean he can become immune to more than one type of damage (1 per copy of Adaptive Plating Subroutine)?</p>\n<p>Thanks in advance for the clarification!</p>\n<p>I have to say, not only is the game awesome, but the creators are super nice!  This is the not the first game company I’ve had direct contact with, and if more people were just as decent to their fans and customers as these guys are, the industry would be so much cooler.  Thank you &gt;G for restoring my faith in humanity!  ;D</p>",
